---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="QuantSoc was founded in 2025 at Swansea University to help students break into quantitative finance from a non-target university."
>
  <section class="container page-intro">
    <h1>About QuantSoc</h1>
    <p>
      QuantSoc was founded in 2025 at Swansea University, a university quant recruiters don't
      traditionally target.
    </p>
    <p>
      We exist to close that gap, through early planning, CV reviews, workshops, and competition
      involvement.
    </p>
    <p>
      Even if quant finance doesn't end up being the goal, you'll come out with a strong
      foundation for a career in fintech or wider finance.
    </p>
    <a href="/what-we-offer">See what we offer →</a>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-intro {
    padding-block: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4rem);
  }

  .page-intro p {
    max-width: 42rem;
  }

  .page-intro p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .page-intro a {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
